# Conformance probe pack for value transforms (spec 0.15) on the `geojson`
# wire. Public. No kinds. `scale` on a coordinate slot (an integer of 1e-7
# degrees), `iscale:1` on the altitude slot, whose digits are read and written
# exactly (ruling 7: 9007199254740993 stays itself), and `iscale:1000` on a
# property (seconds with a fraction to `time_ms`); `scale:10` on a property,
# which refuses a string member (ruling 23).
format  conformance-transforms-geojson
version 0.15.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    geojson
field   uid        id            string
field   lon        geometry.lon  scale:1/10000000
field   lat        geometry.lat  float
field   probe.big  geometry.alt  iscale:1
field   time_ms    properties.t  iscale:1000
field   ce         properties.ce scale:10
